BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    er hands hovering over the threads. She realized that to hoard was to break the cycle; to re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    turn the abundance was to bind the Merchant to her forever. With a smile, she returned nine ) Tj ET
