BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  The Merchant prospered, fueled by the Weaver's integrity. Thus, the law of the bazaar was writ) Tj ET
