BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        ne to catch them. If Thorne caught the silk and wove it into a bridge, the return was gr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        and-a harvest of stardust that nourished them both. Yet, if Thorne greedily hoarded the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        silk, the bridge would collapse, and both would languish in darkness.) Tj ET
