BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        le of creation continued. They realized that when one hoards, the thread remains a mere ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        string, but when one shares, it becomes a tapestry that spans the cosmos. The secret of ) Tj ET
