BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      In the beginning, the Weaver and the Wanderer stood on opposite sides of the Great Chasm. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (        The Weaver held five glimmering shards of light. The Weaver knew that if these shards we) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        re held tight, they would surely dim. If offered to the Wanderer across the void, howeve) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        r, the magic of the chasm would triple their brilliance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      The Weaver extended a hand, casting all five shards into the dark. The Wanderer caught the) Tj ET
