BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        t to illuminate only their own path, or return a portion to the Weaver, honoring the cou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        rage of the gift. Recognizing that the Weaver had risked everything, the Wanderer sent a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (         generous portion back, ensuring that both could walk the bridge safely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      From that day, the inhabitants of the stars learned the law of the Chasm: abundance is nev) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        er found in hoarding. When the Weaver trusts the Wanderer, and the Wanderer honors the W) Tj ET
