BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      Long ago, in the Realm of Echoes, lived two spirits: Aethel, the Weaver of Light, and Thor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        ne, the Keeper of Stones. They resided on separate peaks, divided by an abyss of starlig) Tj ET
