BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      In the beginning, there was only the Void, silent and stagnant. Then, the Weaver and the H) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        arvester met at the edge of existence. The Weaver held a single golden thread, a gift fr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        om the stars. She faced a choice: she could keep it, clutching its warmth in the freezin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        g dark, or she could cast it into the abyss, trusting the Harvester to catch it. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      She cast it forth, and the thread tripled in length, glowing with infinite potential as it) Tj ET
