BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        the bounty. He wove the thread back, returning a portion to the Weaver, ensuring the cyc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        le of creation continued. They realized that when one hoards, the thread remains a mere ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        string, but when one shares, it becomes a tapestry that spans the cosmos. The secret of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        the gods was simple: the value of a token is not in its possession, but in its circulati) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        on. To keep is to remain in shadow; to give is to invite the light of growth. They built) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (         a bridge of golden threads, a testament to the balance between risk and reward. In the ) Tj ET
