BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      In the Realm of Echoes, the Weaver and the Keeper held the balance of existence in their h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (        ands. The Weaver began each cycle with five golden fibers-the essence of potential. To c) Tj ET
