BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        ge, connecting their separate worlds. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      They soon learned that the cycle was not about the gold itself, but the act of passing it ) Tj ET
