BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        st heart, the light grew until it illuminated the stars. Greed was a wall that kept both) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (         in the shadows, while reciprocity was the loom upon which their shared destiny was wove) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        n. Thus, they decreed: he who gives, receives, and he who nurtures the gift finds that t) Tj ET
