BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      Myth: In the Garden of Reciprocal Growth, the gardener Elara planted seeds of trust in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (         fertile soil of the unknown. She knew that to cultivate a harvest, one must first surre) Tj ET
